
# Typed message-passing channel for concurrent tasks.

form channel
  head item
  case sender
    link id, like text
  case receiver
    link id, like text

task make
  head item
  like channel

task send
  head item
  note async
  take target, like channel
  take value, like item

task receive
  head item
  note async
  take source, like channel
  like item
